# meta::summary1 = (human1) Two people are playing a strategy game online involving cards and attacking countries, while discussing dinner plans.
# meta::summary2 = (human2) Jennifer and an unnamed interlocutor engage in a discussion about gameplay involving cards, conquest of countries, and armies, interspersed with trivialities such as deciding what to have for dinner.
# meta::summary3 = (human3) Jennifer and a friend talk about an online game they are currently playing where they take over countries and get cards, while also teasing each other and making plans to grab dinner.
# meta::summary4 = (human4) While playing a game which involves capturing countries and collecting cards, Jennifer and her friend tease each other, banter about other players in the game, and discuss food.
# meta::summary5 = (human5) Two friends discuss a game they are playing, with a particular focus on rules drawing cards as well as strategy involving which countries to attack and fortify, and additionally discuss other plans such as getting dinner.
# meta::summaryClosed1 = (humanC1) Jennifer and a friend chat while playing a game of Risk, discussing game tactics, troop counts, and an aggressive Player 3, while also mixing in discussion of what to do on a following day, considering suggestions such as watching movies and getting food, particularly hot dogs.
# meta::summaryClosed2 = (humanC2) Two friends or a couple play risk while discussing a number of topics including finding a sharp object for an undescribed task, what's happening on the game board (one friend eliminates another unknown player then attempts to attack the other friend), the Chinese food MSG-driven high, and entertaining hot dogs for dinner.
